      NC: { name: 'North Carolina', days: 30, kind: 'cal', trigger: 'termElseVacate', daysRule: '30 calendar days after termination of the tenancy. If your address is unknown to the landlord, the deposit is disposed of under §42-51 after the 30 days.', statute: 'N.C.G.S. §42-52', url: 'https://www.lawhelpnc.org/resource/housing-your-security-deposit',
